stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> NOT_BUILT: AF1 family row created with its oracle
    NOT_BUILT --> BUILT: AF2 generator and validator pass golden and seeded cases
    BUILT --> AUTHORITY_VALIDATED: AF3 authority validator passes on real data, where one exists
    BUILT --> PL01_PASSED: AF4 first real submission accepted in Mode B
    AUTHORITY_VALIDATED --> PL01_PASSED: AF4 first real submission accepted in Mode B
    PL01_PASSED --> VERSION_PENDING: AF5 breaking format version certified for a period
    VERSION_PENDING --> PL01_PASSED: AF6 first real submission on the new version accepted
    PL01_PASSED --> SUSPENDED: AF7 product-caused rejection of a real submission
    VERSION_PENDING --> SUSPENDED: AF7 product-caused rejection of a real submission
    SUSPENDED --> PL01_PASSED: AF8 hold cleared and the next instance accepted

    note right of BUILT
      Coverage lines may read SLA_PENDING_FIRST_SUBMISSION.
      A rejected first submission here opens a D2 defect
      and blocks the family at its gate, nothing more.
    end note

    note right of VERSION_PENDING
      Lines stay IN_SLA.
      Each tenant's first instance on the new
      version runs co-attended in Mode B.
    end note

    note right of SUSPENDED
      Release hold RS8 for the family.
      Existing tenants keep the Mode A fallback.
    end note
